          "talkback": "Turn this on to talk to the room, from Home Assistant 2026.11 (Labs preview, HTTPS and WebRTC) or another client that sends audio on the stream. With the bridge's Dev card the monitor is asked for two-way audio only while someone talks; elsewhere every stream asks for it, which makes the monitor stop a playing lullaby and restart it from the beginning when you close the stream.",
